  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ガラルちほうで　みつかる　ふしぎな\nパワーを　ひめている　いし。ひろうと\nねがいが　かなうとも　いわれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "가라르지방에서 발견되는\n신비한 힘을 간직하고 있는 돌.\n주우면 소원이 이루어진다고도 전해진다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在伽勒爾地區發現的\n蘊藏著神秘力量的石頭。\n據說撿到它就能讓願望成真。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une gemme aux pouvoirs mystérieux que l’on trouve\ndans la région de Galar. On raconte que le vœu\nde la personne l’ayant ramassée se réalisera.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In Galar verstreute Steine, denen eine geheimnisvolle\nEnergie innewohnt. Es wird erzählt, Wünsche gingen in\nErfüllung, wenn man sie aufsammelt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Piedra de poder misterioso hallada en la región de\nGalar. Se dice que quien encuentra una verá realizados\nsus sueños.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pietra dal potere misterioso che si può trovare nella\nregione di Galar. Si dice che possa avverare i desideri\ndi chi la trova.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A stone found in the Galar region with a mysterious power.\nIt’s said that your dreams come true if you find one.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ガラル地方で　みつかる　不思議な\nパワーを　秘めている　石。拾うと\n願いが　叶うとも　いわれている。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "这是一块在伽勒尔地区发现的\n蕴含着神奇力量的石头。听说\n捡到它的人能实现自己的愿望。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Piedra de poder misterioso hallada en la región de\nGalar. Se dice que quien encuentra una verá realizados\nsus sueños.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      }
    }
